        "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\n<head>\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n  <title>井上雄彦访谈页</title>\n  <style>\n    * {\n      box-sizing: border-box;\n    }\n\n    html,\n    body {\n      margin: 0;\n      min-height: 100%;\n      background: #e7e5db;\n    }\n\n    body {\n      display: flex;\n      justify-content: center;\n      color: #292923;\n      font-family: \"Noto Serif CJK SC\", \"Songti SC\", SimSun, serif;\n    }\n\n    .page {\n      width: 760px;\n      min-height: 506px;\n      display: grid;\n      grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr 1fr;\n      background: #efeee6;\n      overflow: hidden;\n    }\n\n    .column {\n      min-width: 0;\n      padding: 7px 38px 17px;\n    }\n\n    .column-center {\n      background: #d3d2ca;\n    }\n\n    .portrait {\n      width: 100%;\n      height: 139px;\n      margin: 0 auto 3px;\n      border: 1px solid #aaa99f;\n      overflow: hidden;\n      color: transparent;\n      font-size: 0;\n      background-color: #b9b9ae;\n    }\n\n    .portrait-left {\n      background:\n        linear-gradient(rgba(14, 30, 28, .12), rgba(14, 30, 28, .12)),\n        repeating-linear-gradient(\n          90deg,\n          #172b29 0 10px,\n          #b43731 10px 13px,\n          #172b29 13px 66px\n        );\n      position: relative;\n    }\n\n    .portrait-left::before {\n      content: \"\";\n      position: absolute;\n      inset: 7px 10px;\n      background:\n        linear-gradient(90deg, transparent 48%, #b9b6a5 48% 52%, transparent 52%),\n        linear-gradient(transparent 48%, #b9b6a5 48% 52%, transparent 52%),\n        #263f3c;\n    }\n\n    .portrait-center {\n      position: relative;\n      background:\n        repeating-linear-gradient(\n          to bottom,\n          #111 0 6px,\n          transparent 6px 14px\n        ) 8px 13px / 7px 105px no-repeat,\n        repeating-linear-gradient(\n          to bottom,\n          #111 0 6px,\n          transparent 6px 14px\n        ) calc(100% - 15px) 13px / 7px 105px no-repeat,\n        #eee;\n    }\n\n    .portrait-center::before {\n      content: \"\";\n      position: absolute;\n      width: 61px;\n      height: 84px;\n      left: 50%;\n      top: 28px;\n      transform: translateX(-50%);\n      border: 3px solid #9d2523;\n      border-radius: 48% 48% 42% 45%;\n    }\n\n    .portrait-center::after {\n      content: \"\";\n      position: absolute;\n      width: 34px;\n      height: 44px;\n      left: calc(50% + 2px);\n      top: 89px;\n      border-left: 3px solid #9d2523;\n      border-right: 3px solid #9d2523;\n      transform: rotate(-8deg);\n    }\n\n    .portrait-right {\n      position: relative;\n      background:\n        linear-gradient(90deg, #092d2b 0 16px, transparent 16px calc(100% - 16px), #092d2b calc(100% - 16px)),\n        #15915e;\n    }\n\n    .portrait-right::before {\n      content: \"\";\n      position: absolute;\n      width: 87px;\n      height: 124px;\n      left: 50%;\n      top: 5px;\n      transform: translateX(-50%);\n      border-radius: 46% 46% 35% 35%;\n      background:\n        linear-gradient(#b94628 0 38%, #c16a49 39% 100%);\n    }\n\n    .placeholder-label {\n      position: absolute;\n      width: 1px;\n      height: 1px;\n      overflow: hidden;\n    }\n\n    .name {\n      margin: 0;\n      padding: 4px 0 7px;\n      border-bottom: 1px solid #85857e;\n      text-align: center;\n      font-family: \"Noto Serif CJK JP\", \"Yu Mincho\", \"MS Mincho\", serif;\n      font-size: 14px;\n      font-weight: 600;\n      letter-spacing: 15px;\n      text-indent: 15px;\n      white-space: nowrap;\n    }\n\n    .text {\n      margin-top: 14px;\n      font-size: 11.5px;\n      line-height: 1.58;\n      text-align: justify;\n      text-justify: inter-ideograph;\n    }\n\n    .text p {\n      margin: 0 0 7px;\n      text-indent: 2em;\n    }\n\n    .text p:first-child {\n      text-indent: 0;\n    }\n\n    .column-center .text {\n      margin-top: 11px;\n      font-size: 10.5px;\n      line-height: 1.47;\n    }\n\n    .column-right .text {\n      font-size: 12.5px;\n      line-height: 1.65;\n    }\n\n    @media (max-width: 620px) {\n      body {\n        justify-content: flex-start;\n        overflow-x: auto;\n      }\n\n      .page {\n        flex: 0 0 760px;\n      }\n    }\n  </style>\n  <script>\n    window.MathJax = {\n      tex: {\n        inlineMath: [[\"$\", \"$\"]],\n        displayMath: [[\"$$\", \"$$\"]]\n      }\n    };\n  </script>\n  <script async src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/mathjax@3/es5/tex-mml-chtml.js\"></script>\n</head>\n<body>\n  <main class=\"page\">\n    <section class=\"column column-left\">\n      <figure class=\"placeholder portrait portrait-left\" aria-label=\"四格人物照片\">\n        <figcaption class=\"placeholder-label\">[照片：四格人物肖像，顶部居中]</figcaption>\n      </figure>\n      <h2 class=\"name\">井上雄彦</h2>\n      <div class=\"text\">\n        <p>最近，我突然想养只狗。</p>\n        <p>小时候，我非常喜欢猫、狗之类的动物，记得自己曾经给街坊的狗随便取名叫“卡洛”，跟它一起玩。我现在的街坊也养着一只大狗，名字叫“银次”。当我从隔着差不多跟我一般高的院墙外喊“银次”的时候，它便会伸出大大的脑袋，并把两只大大的前爪搭在院墙上，一直盯着我。每当这时，我就想如果自己养一只大狗该多好啊。</p>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <section class=\"column column-center\">\n      <figure class=\"placeholder portrait portrait-center\" aria-label=\"红色线描人物插图\">\n        <figcaption class=\"placeholder-label\">[插图：红色线描人物头像，顶部居中]</figcaption>\n      </figure>\n      <h2 class=\"name\">井上雄彦</h2>\n      <div class=\"text\">\n        <p>刚开始画“灌篮高手”时的愿望，如今已经实现了两个。</p>\n        <p>一个是以采访为名而往美国观察NBA的动态，另一个也是以采访为名而往巴塞罗那现场观看奥运会。真要感谢上帝。</p>\n        <p>下一个愿望是希望能看到日本篮球队获得奥运会的银牌。那些小学生读者曾经在来信中写到，“自从我看了《灌篮高手》后就开始打篮球了”。如果这些孩子们长大之后……实现我的梦想的话……我一定会激动得放声大哭……</p>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <section class=\"column column-right\">\n      <figure class=\"placeholder portrait portrait-right\" aria-label=\"彩色人物肖像\">\n        <figcaption class=\"placeholder-label\">[肖像：橙色头发人物，绿色背景，顶部居中]</figcaption>\n      </figure>\n      <h2 class=\"name\">井上雄彦</h2>\n      <div class=\"text\">\n        <p>多亏大家的支持，《灌篮高手》才能出版第10卷，衷心感谢各位读者朋友。</p>\n        <p>自开始连载已经过去了两年，然而故事中才刚过两个月。如果连载了两年才过两个月的话，那樱木他们升高二的时候岂不是还要等12年，到他们毕业的话，还要等36年……</p>\n        <p>我想不会的……</p>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n  </main>\n</body>\n</html>"
